    "content": "Mogadishu, September 24, 2026 – Somalia's Minister of Defense, Ahmed Moalim Fiqi, received a high-level delegation from Italy's Ministry of Defense and Armed Forces at his office in Mogadishu on Wednesday. The delegation was led by General Giovanni Maria Iannucci, Commander of the Italian Joint Operations Command, and included Italy's Ambassador to Somalia, Pier Mario Daccò Coppi. The meeting focused on reinforcing defense and security cooperation between the two countries.\n\nThe talks come amid ongoing efforts by Somalia to strengthen its national security institutions and combat al-Shabab. Italy has been a longstanding partner in supporting Somali security forces through training and capacity-building initiatives. This latest engagement underscores Italy's continued commitment to stability in the Horn of Africa.\n\nDuring the meeting, both sides reportedly discussed ways to deepen bilateral ties in defense and security, though specific details of the discussions were not immediately disclosed. The presence of Ambassador Daccò Coppi highlights the diplomatic dimension of the cooperation, which extends beyond military matters to include broader bilateral relations.\n\nFor the Somali diaspora, this development signals continued international support for Somalia's security sector reform. Many diaspora members have relatives serving in the security forces or are themselves involved in rebuilding the nation. Enhanced cooperation with Italy could lead to more opportunities for training and equipment, potentially improving the effectiveness of Somali forces in protecting civilians.\n\nItaly has historically been a key ally of Somalia, with ties dating back to the colonial period and continuing through various development and security partnerships. The meeting reflects a mutual interest in ensuring that Somalia can eventually take full responsibility for its own security, a goal that aligns with the African Union's transition plan.\n\nRead the original report from Goobjoog here: https://goobjoog.com/2026/09/24/soomaaliya-iyo-talyaaniga-oo-ka-wada-hadlay-iskaashiga-difaaca-iyo-amniga/",
